"Copyright Holder" means the individual holding the covered rights and
identified by the pseudonym "Cododel" in the copyright notice above.
"Program" means the Projector code and other Projector materials to which
this License is applied, excluding separately licensed third-party components.
A "Fork" is a modified version of the Program, including a renamed version.
A "Distribution" is supplying copies of the Program or a Fork to others
outside your own internal use. Internal use includes use within an
organization or team for its own operations.

"Complete Corresponding Source" means the preferred editable source for the
exact version distributed: the Program, all modifications, and the build
files, configuration and scripts needed to build and install that version,
including dependency declarations. Unmodified general-purpose build tools
and operating-system components may be obtained separately. Third-party
components remain subject to their own licenses and source obligations.

2. Free use and internal modification

