Using the Program to produce work for which you are paid does not itself
require a separate commercial agreement.

You may create and use internal corporate or team versions without payment.
Modifications that are not distributed to others do not have to be disclosed.

3. Free distribution and corresponding source

You may distribute the original Program and Forks without charging for the
Program or Fork, provided that:

(a) you provide the Complete Corresponding Source for the version distributed
